00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:13.030
Just, actually being thoughtful

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:14.480
about what you're putting in your body.

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.870
You look at the natural wine craze.

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:18.590
You look at the alcohol levels

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:21.650
and wine coming down in
California, more balanced.

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:23.540
And it's been really
interesting and fun to watch.

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:26.440
And, it's funny, I'm curious

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:27.670
